{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5fb3286da4d4518b06c063c86194670a155b16ae1ceb6bc2425e8b258ced540b", "ja": "見えない共通点", "zh": "看不见的共同点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7692a8a5c8170f9b369799749a4922886f4336cc135de8171867e6100db76fb9", "ja": "紬は自分とはまるで違う、苦手意識さえ\nあったクロエと同じ体験をした事に悩んで\nいた。のり子と話すうち、自分とクロエには\n『仲間』という共通の存在があると気付いた\n紬は、少しだけクロエが掴めたと微笑む。", "zh": "紬正为自己竟然和克洛伊有着相同的经历而烦恼不已。克洛伊和自己截然不同，甚至让她感到有些棘手。和典子交谈时，紬意识到自己和克洛伊有一个共同的存在，那就是“伙伴”，于是微笑着表示，自己稍微理解克洛伊一些了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "316983d42d5eec3830bbe2ece6fcbf3d26ce4143b7d23b58c5b87b3c3602f241", "ja": "ふう……いろんなとこ走って、\n気持ちよかったー！　紬、どうだった？", "zh": "呼……骑车到处兜了一圈，真舒服——！紬，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "72f2da563000213444e6c73fdeb6eda8388002fa12783cd543fca2cb8ba9a417", "ja": "バイクの二人乗りなんて、あんまやらないよね？\n酔ってない？　平気？", "zh": "双人骑摩托车这种事，平时不太会做吧？\n没晕车吧？还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8538a5927c152907c757e60017bc497300de27ad245482f671ecd175e8967ca2", "ja": "は、はい、ちっとも。風を切る感覚が爽やかで、\n福田さんの背中が温かくて、安心できて……。", "zh": "是、是的，一点也不晕。迎风而行的感觉很清爽，福田小姐的后背也很温暖，让我觉得很安心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "38cd7e49c50db43d5dcdffcee4a6e4c104c0bcd252b68702122effbf6ddc0c72", "ja": "とても気持ちがよかったです。\nバイクとは、こんなにいいものなんですね……。", "zh": "真的感觉非常棒。\n原来骑摩托车是这么舒服的事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "5d034a27fd865102a4d849b90684c2f1c08f8de9066d6e79ad3af94395e6c393", "ja": "ホント？　アタシ流の気晴らし、\n楽しんでもらえてよかった♪", "zh": "真的？你能享受我这种放松心情的方式，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0ab559e0268dd8169013ef8522be94f0d368304e0a7111f1db73b1f5a4d6cae6", "ja": "気晴らし……。\nということは……。", "zh": "消遣……。\n这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "80f6aa1b898075d2a23dd49a3d1922b8d91a383ca43e4b8cfa5474243b223060", "ja": "この間の番組でのこと、気にしてるよね？\nお芝居と、似たような感じになっちゃったこと。", "zh": "你还在介意前阵子节目上的事吧？\n变得和演戏差不多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "98e9e2eb600b4f319932a3b1f2bb1318fd9cc98ceb0cb8a7f564c922ba265601", "ja": "……！\nはい。", "zh": "……！\n嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "6777bdc496687805fde687f24a847478554f995c24e6200c1e11a9fa814b8b33", "ja": "あのね。アタシはあれ、\nすごいチャンスだと思ったよ！", "zh": "我说啊，我觉得那件事\n是个天大的好机会哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2d6c759222f5bb6415fcb35faf9110e9468163939b47d4e1fd233dae3dc0c822", "ja": "チャンス……ですか？", "zh": "机会……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae8939637002bd3c88a1365376938fcc01bd2254bff84a176e0c703231027b60", "ja": "うん！　だってお芝居と同じ経験なんて、\n普通しないでしょ？　なんか、奇跡みたいじゃない？", "zh": "嗯！因为像演戏这样的经历，平时不会遇到吧？感觉就像奇迹一样，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "b20d4e3bfb73084986d30c312b28e5fdc93e29b5596e978b950ecce0928010c1", "ja": "だから……うう、なんて言えばいいんだろ？\n紬に落ち込んでほしくないなって思って、それで……！", "zh": "所以……呜，该怎么说才好呢？\n我只是不希望紬消沉，所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "41fac9e06cfaf5cc85f43e383f41795f4a689d06c8e9af69f69b3a955eb0d04e", "ja": "……。激励を、くださっているのですね。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "……您是在鼓励我对吧。\n非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fb8485060cb47952abb99afe123e5bb2f28de03f10d899f1b1ef300fa4287653", "ja": "チャンス……福田さんの仰るとおりかと。\n私は、同じ経験をしたからこそ悩んでいました。", "zh": "机会……我想，正如福田小姐所说。\n正因为有过相同的经历，我才一直烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "cdae2167b9d1525fc9f614b115310c552f0a949862974344dd343011dc62b1c6", "ja": "え？　そうなの？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f973c4a6d59722a3f25795282fc831469ca6991518004e21dfa6a8525a0fe923", "ja": "はい。……第五幕までのクロエは、正直、\n私の好きな人物像ではありませんでした。", "zh": "是的。……说实话，在第五幕之前，克洛伊并不是我喜欢的那种人物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fee5276616c416b5e1cfd0afb77c35e20cc1b21602f4153eff25692c178a1195", "ja": "高い技量を持っていて、自信家。\n自分とは似ても似つかぬ、まるで違う人物だと……。", "zh": "拥有高超的技艺，而且很自信。和自己完全不像，是截然不同的人物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "297ee6bf6f8ccddb0f7029266dbb45450889da4f121b9299d810ea33ae849921", "ja": "なるほど……。\n確かに、紬は自信家って感じじゃないよね。", "zh": "原来如此……。\n确实，紬给人的感觉并不是个自信的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "797a375325fb677c4f8594822c952d79e77a052098c8e7428e21cbf608e44ce2", "ja": "クロエは劇中で、「無自覚に笑いを取った」シーンが\nありました。そしてご存知の通り、私も……。", "zh": "克洛伊在剧中有过“无意间逗笑了大家”的场景。而众所周知，我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "19392a7dcbfab7e83571b187c59b5ee1001cc4e84bf3ebbc7b0b78b9090109cd", "ja": "それなら、自分が気付いていないだけで、私には\nクロエと似たところがあるのかもしれない……。", "zh": "那样的话，说不定只是我自己没有察觉，其实我也有和克洛伊相似的地方……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0ad765b3f4275e089ce598d59a2c8e1620878ee22879423a687af461f35bdab3", "ja": "でも……だとしたら、一体どこが？と……。\n自分とは、対極にあると思っていたので……。", "zh": "可是……如果真是这样，那到底是哪里像呢？我这么想着……\n因为我一直以为，自己和她是截然相反的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "556ee1626464ad4734c4d3b48b30be8e8edbf5c68a975b261bf0e490e7c60d31", "ja": "天然だとか、それらしい言葉だけは浮かびますが。\n実感は得られず、悩んでしまい……。", "zh": "虽说脑海里能浮现出天然之类的贴切词汇，\n但我却毫无实感，陷入了苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "6f109b0bbf0d6c98c88d8d225b8b2d4bfa1958f40b7ce355e8ae5096e8797fb0", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。\nもっと早く言ってくれればよかったのに。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……  \n你要是早点告诉我就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a347cc45b496f3eed08b20e161d5a434add4d23f7c17bf5a0b8d6ec903eaa8cd", "ja": "それは……私の都合で、みなさんの\n稽古の時間を奪うのは忍びなく……。", "zh": "那是因为……我不想因为自己的缘故，占用大家的练习时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "ed0015a368989188267834e5160d33bac499339631fbbd7bbb0383032c99a8e6", "ja": "もう！　翼やひなたが聞いたら、悲しんじゃうよ？\n相談してくれないなんてーって。", "zh": "真是的！要是让翼和日向听见了，她们会伤心的哦？\n会因为你都不来找我们商量而伤心的——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1a59b1a121b402201fbdb8149671d155cdb94d7a533ec8a4f21f4eb0bf7b7dfb", "ja": "そう、ですね。\nみなさんは、いつもそうやって……。あ。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。大家总是这样……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "22502c665b775aff69d9bc977b188f4d5731b45352f6d12bb2495d0948198f56", "ja": "？\nどうしたの？", "zh": "？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d795bef0faa2e9f36baa8b21f289bbae3b8ca8ad51267adbe00f26d2c594d697", "ja": "……気付きました。\n私とクロエの、共通点……。", "zh": "……我想到了。\n我和克洛伊的共同点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "19bb9e6eeb35a91c23ce10a0b588f314e0b4739bb944e6e036d051e2e5d2e063", "ja": "今のように、私に言葉をくれる存在がいることです。\nクロエに藍がいるように、私には、福田さんが。", "zh": "就像现在这样，有一个会对我说话的存在。\n正如克洛伊有蓝，我也有福田小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "6c731cdc560642a18942e5788c1ad757b081d289c1a8e1101bb5cb5ab4a04a87", "ja": "あ……！", "zh": "啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "77bcc542ed3ae975190c20a27f8e6715d9128959d54aeedb235793bddcfa09cc", "ja": "劇場のみなさんは、いつも私を気にかけてくださって。\n私の知らない、私の良いところを見つけてくれます。", "zh": "剧场的大家总是很关心我。\n还会帮我找到连自己都不知道的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "331ba63c7f4319c8bee065e7117986b33b270cb2aa9c27397c060f998b8c80f1", "ja": "そのたび、驚かされます。新しい視点や\n物事の捉え方、気付かされることが多くて……。", "zh": "每次都会让我大吃一惊。大家总能让我发现新的视角和看待事物的方式，也让我意识到许多以前没注意到的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e798d44238ce48f8040e8058eb10d658d5ec46f8cfb1bf719c8900408e3a41a9", "ja": "藍にずばりと言われたクロエも、\nおおいに驚いていましたから。", "zh": "被藍直言点出的克洛伊，\n也大为惊讶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "2196923257eb78acca9ce69739296d31c9dc5b897e6f43a439453f48aeb38357", "ja": "あはは、そうだね。\n自分が変人だって言われて、自覚なかったもんね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，也是呢。\n被别人说是怪人，自己却完全没有自觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9dd30ee72d160e0dd98a2f74783ae10ac365b4c1edc7e97a44e7d2185a7035fa", "ja": "そうなんです。自分のことばかり考えているのに、\nちっとも自分のことが分かっていないんです。", "zh": "就是这样。明明总是在考虑自己的事，却一点都不了解自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c58cf27f7a673b85d276f13e59c42856f6e7a6f5e92b9791b4488260a801f3ff", "ja": "あまりにも無自覚で、覚束ないまま……。\nでも、そうやって進むしかない……。", "zh": "太过不自知，跌跌撞撞地……。\n可是，也只能这样走下去……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5a3ad6023bb7ee8615fc8651955df9a867482ec1b844234d6b42ee45018a7e8d", "ja": "それしかできない……。\nきっと、それが私とクロエの……。……。", "zh": "我只能做到这些……  \n一定就是我和クロエ的……。……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "5ed51fddcd6ca4c931b85a7746533b9dee02136a510efe049381e212294aca6d", "ja": "紬……？", "zh": "紬……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1038_051tmg", "source_sha256": "82eb7ac127cfb35059841c95351277f1fb18a2273b8ffb88dc4e3741fa5f5d23", "ja": "……あの、福田さん。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "……那个，福田小姐。\n谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "03fba598731b303ba1140280aeec32ca6766a8bbf9fe1690272fedcb4b82831c", "ja": "少しだけ……\nクロエが、掴めたような気がします。", "zh": "我感觉……\n稍微抓住了一点克洛伊的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "ef51d88b6b56d89d7a125c6f02f9deb05d949c4b4c8f354bee986f367c0e34ac", "ja": "ホント！？　よかった～！\nアタシも紬と話せて、すっごい参考になった！", "zh": "真的！？太好了——！\n我和紬聊了之后，也觉得特别有参考价值！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "02c4f0a534def26090b9289390bb782aca939893a5a28d5c40af64313a3f3445", "ja": "なんだかクロエって……アタシが思ってたよりも\nずっと不器用な子なのかもな～って。", "zh": "总觉得克洛伊她……或许是个比我想象中还要笨拙得多的孩子呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_03_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0b394fde0ad46f25508c9f70a55524ea7ac5b6d23935e20b8f197a8d29241b7d", "ja": "はい。私も、同じ感想です。\nふふっ……。", "zh": "是的，我也有同样的感想。\n呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
